So far, we've cleaned the postseason dataset, identified the teams, and calculated each batter's postseason wOBA with their name and ID. Next, we'll find a 2025 salary dataset and merge it with our results. We'll also calculate pitchers' wOBA allowed. Finally, we'll compare Blue Jays players with similarly paid players. from other postseason teams to see who overperformed or underperformed.
